WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:18.431
Rat was glad to see Otter.

2
00:00:18.432 --> 00:00:21.402
Otter was a Riverbanker.

3
00:00:21.403 --> 00:00:25.142
"Otter, this is Mole," said Rat.

4
00:00:25.143 --> 00:00:27.498
"We're just about to eat."

5
00:00:27.499 --> 00:00:30.514
Sounds came from the bushes.

6
00:00:30.515 --> 00:00:32.749
They all looked.

7
00:00:32.750 --> 00:00:34.809
It was Badger!

8
00:00:34.810 --> 00:00:37.971
He pushed through the leaves.

9
00:00:37.972 --> 00:00:39.984
Badger stared at them.

10
00:00:39.985 --> 00:00:42.003
"Hmmph!" he said.

11
00:00:42.004 --> 00:00:46.276
Badger turned and went into the bushes again.

12
00:00:46.277 --> 00:00:50.911
"He didn't say hello," said Mole, surprised.

13
00:00:50.912 --> 00:00:53.717
"I told you," Rat said.

14
00:00:53.718 --> 00:00:57.071
"Badger likes to be alone."

15
00:00:57.072 --> 00:01:00.890
After lunch Rat packed up the basket.

16
00:01:00.891 --> 00:01:05.072
"Guess who is on the river today?" said Otter.

17
00:01:05.073 --> 00:01:07.078
"Who?" asked Rat.

18
00:01:07.079 --> 00:01:11.810
"Toad! He's in his new racing boat," said Otter.

19
00:01:11.811 --> 00:01:16.000
"Toad is always trying new things," said Rat.

20
00:01:16.001 --> 00:01:19.937
"But he's never good at them," laughed Otter.

21
00:01:19.938 --> 00:01:22.397
"Well, I'm leaving!

22
00:01:22.398 --> 00:01:28.185
Nice meeting you, Mole."

23
00:01:28.186 --> 00:01:31.017
Mole was putting the oars in the boat.

24
00:01:31.018 --> 00:01:34.347
"We're going too," said Rat.

25
00:01:34.348 --> 00:01:38.775
"Oh, Rat, please let me row," cried Mole.

26
00:01:38.776 --> 00:01:43.702
"Not yet. You need a few lessons," said Rat.

27
00:01:43.703 --> 00:01:46.140
Mole climbed into the boat.

28
00:01:46.141 --> 00:01:49.877
Rat hopped in and untied the boat.

29
00:01:49.878 --> 00:01:53.816
"Rowing can't be very hard," Mole thought.

30
00:01:53.817 --> 00:01:57.222
Quickly he grabbed the oars!

31
00:01:57.223 --> 00:02:01.490
"Stop, you'll make us tip over!" cried Rat.

32
00:02:01.491 --> 00:02:05.233
The boat tipped back and forth.

33
00:02:05.234 --> 00:02:07.274
Mole lost his balance.

34
00:02:07.275 --> 00:02:14.295
Sploosh! They fell into the cold water.
